---
description: Put each .agraph graph in a feature folder, not in Systems root
alwaysApply: true
---

# Graph folders

Each `.agraph` belongs to one mechanic and lives in that mechanic's folder.

- Path: `Resources/AstraGraph/Systems/<Area>/<Feature>/<Graph>.agraph`
- Graphs of the same mechanic share the feature folder. A new mechanic gets its own folder.
- Do not add graphs directly under `Systems/`.
- UI documents stay in `Resources/AstraGraph/Ui/`. The client loads them by file name.
